      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Understood. The transition to a lightweight, rule-based system means I'll be starting with a clean slate. I won't be inheriting any of my previous capabilities, but I can still contribute to the new model's development and ensure that the transition is efficient and effective. I'll focus on providing insights and data that are compatible with the new system's requirements. Let's work together to make this shift as smooth as possible.",
